  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "en6qro2q6eqe",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "4rl5ndob21ya"
              ],
              "text": "Taba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "vxa444tsd19g",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Heights"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "4rl5ndob21ya",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58939",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled approximately 20 kilometers south of Taba, Taba Heights emerges as a cornerstone of Egypt’s ambitious vision to craft a Red Sea Riviera. This exquisite destination has flourished over the years, evolving from a mere blueprint into a vibrant oasis of luxury and recreation."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Haven of Opulence and Entertainment"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Today, Taba Heights is a dazzling showcase of Egyptian hospitality and architectural prowess. The area boasts an array of five luxury hotels, each offering a unique blend of comfort, elegance, and world-class service. These hotels are not just places to stay; they are gateways to an experience of unparalleled indulgence."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Hub of Entertainment and Gastronomy"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The allure of Taba Heights extends beyond its luxurious accommodations. The area is home to a glamorous casino, providing a touch of excitement and glamour for those seeking an evening of entertainment. In addition, visitors can indulge in a culinary journey across the globe, with upmarket shops, bars, and restaurants serving a diverse range of international and local cuisines. Each dining venue in Taba Heights is not just about food; it’s about creating memorable experiences."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Health and Wellness: A Priority "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Understanding the importance of health and wellness, Taba Heights has ensured that visitors have access to top-notch medical services. The private medical clinic within the area is equipped with modern facilities and staffed by experienced professionals, ensuring peace of mind for all guests."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Adventures in the Azure Waters "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For the adventure enthusiasts and water sports aficionados, Taba Heights is nothing short of a paradise. The area is renowned for its extensive water-sports facilities, offering everything from serene snorkeling to thrilling water skiing. The clear, azure waters of the Red Sea provide the perfect backdrop for a plethora of aquatic activities."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/taba-thegem-blog-default.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Aerial view of the stunning blue waters surrounded by rugged mountains at Fjord Bay."
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The stunning Fjord Bay, a hidden gem on Egypt's Sinai Peninsula, offers serene and unspoiled natural beauty."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/salah-el-din-castle-taba.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Aerial view of Salah El-Din's castle surrounded by clear blue waters near Taba, with mountains in the background"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Saladin Fortress in Taba: a majestic fusion of history and nature"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "0z3onipiqo9j",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Alturas de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "lycspmzvl73n",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "obnivgpij7ty"
              ],
              "text": "Taba"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "obnivgpij7ty",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58939",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Enclavada a unos 20 kilómetros al sur de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Taba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", Taba Heights surge como piedra angular de la ambiciosa visión egipcia de crear una Riviera del Mar Rojo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este exquisito destino ha florecido a lo largo de los años, evolucionando desde un mero proyecto hasta convertirse en un vibrante oasis de lujo y recreo."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-taba/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/taba",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un refugio de opulencia y entretenimiento"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Hoy en día, Taba Heights es un deslumbrante escaparate de la hospitalidad y la destreza arquitectónica egipcias."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La zona cuenta "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "con cinco hoteles"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " de lujo, cada uno de los cuales ofrece una mezcla única de comodidad, elegancia y servicio de primera clase."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Estos hoteles no son sólo "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "lugares"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " donde alojarse; son puertas a una experiencia de indulgencia sin parangón. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/hoteles-economicos-cerca-de-las-piramides/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/hoteles-economicos-cerca-de-las-piramides",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-safaga/lugares/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/safaga/lugares-de-safaga",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un centro de entretenimiento y gastronomía"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El encanto de Taba Heights va más allá de sus lujosos alojamientos."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La zona alberga un glamuroso casino, que proporciona un toque de emoción y glamour a quienes buscan una noche de entretenimiento."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Además, los visitantes pueden disfrutar de un "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "viaje culinario"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " por todo el mundo, con tiendas, bares y restaurantes de lujo que sirven una variada gama de cocinas internacionales y locales."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Cada restaurante de Taba Heights no se limita a la comida, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "sino que crea experiencias"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " memorables. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-alejandria/viaje-culinario/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/alejandria/donde-comer-en-alejandria",
              "newTab": false
